{"id": "the-merchants-refuge", "ids": "⿸广⿱从貝", "title": "The Merchant's Refuge", "pronunciation": "cóng", "bopomofo": "ㄘㄨㄥˊ", "meaning": "A sheltered marketplace or trading post where merchants gather to conduct business.", "formation": "phono-semantic", "definitions": [{"zh": "商賈聚集之所，有屋舍庇護之市集", "en": "A covered marketplace where merchants congregate"}, {"zh": "貿易往來之據點，商旅投宿處", "en": "A trading post or commercial waystation for traveling merchants"}, {"zh": "財貨雲集之地，商業繁盛之象", "en": "A symbol of commercial prosperity and wealth accumulation"}], "etymology": "In the shadow economies of ancient trade routes, there existed sheltered spaces where merchants would gather under one roof, their shells and coins mingling in whispered negotiations. This character captures that essential fusion of shelter and commerce, of protection and profit, that defined the merchant quarters of forgotten cities. It speaks to humanity's eternal need for safe harbor in the storms of trade.", "source": {"work": "《集韻》", "gloss": "市廛也。從广从貝會意。昨宗切。"}, "components": [{"char": "广", "meaning": "shelter"}, {"char": "从", "meaning": "从"}, {"char": "貝", "meaning": "shell/money"}], "examples": [{"text": "胡商西來，止於城東之⿸广⿱从貝，貨物山積", "translation": "Foreign merchants came from the west and lodged at the eastern trading post, their goods piled high as mountains", "style": "classical"}, {"text": "此⿸广⿱从貝雖小，然日進斗金，商賈雲集", "translation": "Though this marketplace is small, it generates tremendous daily profits with merchants flocking here", "style": "contemporary"}], "related": [{"char": "廛", "pinyin": "chán", "gloss": "market stall"}, {"char": "肆", "pinyin": "sì", "gloss": "shop, store"}, {"char": "賈", "pinyin": "jiǎ", "gloss": "merchant"}], "tags": ["commerce", "shelter", "marketplace", "trade"], "svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" width=\"512\" height=\"512\">\n<style>@import url(\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Serif+TC:wght@400;700&display=swap\");</style>\n<g trans